e\">20-df-mod-finite</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Maximal}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\nM\\in\\mathcal E\\land|\\omega\\setminus M|=\\omega\\land\n\\forall W\\in\\mathcal E\\\n[M\\subseteq W\\Rightarrow(W=^*M\\lor W=^*\\omega)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Maximal}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\nM\\in\\mathcal E\\land|\\omega\\setminus M|=\\omega\\land\n\\forall W\\in\\mathcal E\\\n[M\\subseteq W\\Rightarrow(W=^*M\\lor W=^*\\omega)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>必须余无限；省略后 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 本身会被误判极大。M⊆W 与 M⊆<em>W 的版本等价：把有限遗漏补进 W 即可。极大性是 E</em> 中真 coatom 的性质。</p>\n<p>来源：书外既有条目的规范化；标准 maximal 定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mod-finite","status":"resolved","id":"68ee45ca9dee2182","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-mod-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-mod-finite]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mod-finite","status":"resolved","id":"68ee45ca9dee2182","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-mod-finite]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M\\subseteq\\o